OL,3,CNoel Gallagher shocked and saddened by
OL,4,CMan City development
OL,6,FNoel Gallagher has described his
OL,7,F"shock" at the news of Manchester City
OL,8,Fbeing found guilty on virtually all
OL,9,Fcounts of breaching Premier League
OL,10,Ffinancial rules.
OL,12,FNews broke on Friday, 25 September,
OL,13,Fthat City had been found guilty on all
OL,14,Fbut one of the 115 charges laid by the
OL,15,FPremier League in February 2023,
OL,16,Fcharges the club have always
OL,17,Fstrenuously denied.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@GO]
