OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790434088
OL,3,CNoel Gallagher shocked and saddened by
OL,4,CMan City development
OL,6,FLife-long City fan and Oasis star Noel
OL,7,FGallagher shared his thoughts on the
OL,8,Fnews, describing it as "quite sad" for
OL,9,Ffans and players.
OL,11,FSpeaking on the Let Me Talk podcast,
OL,12,Fhe said: "A little surprised when I
OL,13,Fheard it on the radio. Surprised
OL,14,Fbecause only that the club have
OL,15,Fassured us all along that they
OL,16,Fvehemently denied any of these charges.
OL,26,@pD@XOUpD@bO]tD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790434088
OL,3,CNoel Gallagher shocked and saddened by
OL,4,CMan City development
OL,6,F"So it was a bit of a shock to find
OL,7,Fout that we've been found guilty of
OL,8,Fall but one. But really overall just
OL,9,Fquite sad really. Sad for the fans and
OL,10,Ffor the players."
OL,12,FAsked if it changes the context of
OL,13,Fmoments like Sergio Aguero's title-
OL,14,Fwinning goal in 2012, Gallagher added:
OL,15,F"Our focus as fans is always on the
OL,16,Fpitch and we know what we saw ` they
OL,17,Fwon it on the pitch.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@QO]wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790434088
OL,3,CNoel Gallagher shocked and saddened by
OL,4,CMan City development
OL,6,F"Whatever goes on in the boardroom,
OL,7,Fit's nothing to do with the supporters
OL,8,For the players. The players won that
OL,9,Fgame and won that title on the pitch.
OL,11,F"Whether some of those players should
OL,12,Fhave been there or not, that's nothing
OL,13,Fto do with the fans. We were there, we
OL,14,Fknow what we saw.
OL,16,F"Does it taint it? I suppose in the
OL,17,Feyes of everybody else in England it
OL,18,Fwould, but I know what I saw and I
OL,19,Fknow what I felt."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU{D@RO]
