OL,3,CNoel Gallagher shocked and saddened by
OL,4,CMan City development
OL,6,FIt is believed Manchester City are to
OL,7,Fappeal the charges. A spokesperson
OL,8,Ffrom the club said: "The Premier
OL,9,FLeague process remains ongoing, with
OL,10,Fsignificant elements to be completed,
OL,11,Fand subject to strict confidentiality.
OL,13,F"As such Manchester City FC's position
OL,14,Fremains consistent with the Club's
OL,15,Fstatement of February 2023.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
