PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1790434088
OL,3,CNoel Gallagher shocked and saddened by
OL,4,CMan City development
OL,6,F"The Club has diligently respected due
OL,7,Fprocess for eight years on the basis
OL,8,Fthat the Premier League Board and
OL,9,FExecutive would behave as an
OL,10,Findependent, impartial and fair-minded
OL,11,Fregulator, free from partisan
OL,12,Finfluence."
OL,14,FThe Premier League declined to comment
OL,15,Fwhen contacted and stressed the
OL,16,Fprocess is ongoing.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
